ested versions\n\n4.6.2 stable \nCan not find a version where it works, appears like this happened when accesskit was implemented\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.2.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5050 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9159) - AMD Ryzen 9 5950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads) - 63.91 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWith a screen reader, when you focus on an EditorInspectorSection like layout, it will read out \"Section: Layout  Section: Layout\".\n\nIf you manually set the accessibility name, it does not change it. So it appears EditorInspectorSections do not use their accessibility name to build their accessibility element.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nActivate a screen reader\nSet focus to any EditorInspectorSection in inspector\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nA blank godot project works.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119363/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"hear